{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.reachable_nonempty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.reachable_nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L78-L87","doc":"**The reachable set is nonempty** — a sorry-free consequence of universality\n(density at `ε = 1` around any point of a nonempty target). Demonstrates the\ncarrier has teeth: assuming the conjecture, the braid image is inhabited. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.cost_antitone","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.cost_antitone","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L76-L76","doc":"**Efficient approximation (Solovay–Kitaev shape).** Finer precision costs\nno fewer crossings: `ε' < ε ⇒ cost ε ≤ cost ε'`. The weak monotone shell of\nthe block's `c = O(N·polylog(1/ε))` bound. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.cost","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.cost","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L72-L72","doc":"Crossing budget for an `ε`-approximation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.dense","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.dense","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L70-L70","doc":"**Quantum universality (density in `SU(2^n)`).** Every target unitary `g`\nis approximated to arbitrary precision `ε > 0` by a reachable one: the FKLW\ndensity of the braid-group image at the root of unity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.reachable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.reachable","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L66-L66","doc":"The unitaries reachable by finite braid words at the root of unity `q_k` —\nthe image of the braiding representation `ρ_{q_k}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality.mk","kind":"ctor","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L63-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumComputationalUniversality.QuantumComputationalUniversality","kind":"class","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumComputationalUniversality/QuantumComputationalUniversality.lean#L58-L76","doc":"**Quantum computational universality** at a root of unity (content-bearing\n§3b-tax primary conjecture carrier). `U` is the target unitary group\n`SU(2^n)` (a metric space under the operator-norm distance).\n\n-- @conjecture: primary ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:quantum-computational-universality","label":"conj:quantum-computational-universality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/quantum-computational-universality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}